module in this file is an ancestor of the heavy `MaedaGalois5Defs` chain.
This module is registered in the root `MathProof.lean` only (not in
`defaultTargets`/CI): it imports `MaedaT3SmallWeights`, which is deliberately
not a CI item — see the note in `lakefile.toml`.
-/

